sequenceDiagram
  participant R1 as Request R1 / snapshot v1
  participant REG as ExtensionRegistry
  participant ADM as Admin reload
  participant R2 as Request R2 / snapshot v2
  R1->>REG: acquire demo:Read lease(v1)
  ADM->>REG: publish revision 2 / unload v1
  REG-->>R2: new snapshot excludes v1
  R1->>R1: 已获 lease 继续并配对结果
  R2-xREG: 不能从旧 snapshot 新 acquire v1
  R1->>REG: release lease(v1)
